(S, "Ali is 5 years old and his sister is 3 times his age. How old will his sister be when Ali is 10 years old?", ["15", "20", "25", "30"], 1, "The sister is 3 x 5 = 15, so she is 10 years older than Ali. When Ali is 10 she will be 20.", "The age difference between two people stays the same over time.", [1741]),
